### ==================== USERS ====================

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "israel_israeli",
    "name": "Israel Israeli",
    "phone": "050-1234567",
    "address": "Be'er Ya'akov",
    "password": "mySecretPassword"
}

###

### Register a second user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "israela_israeli",
    "name": "Israela Israeli",
    "phone": "052-7654321",
    "address": "Tel Aviv",
    "password": "anotherPassword"
}

###

### Register user with missing fields (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Israel Israeli"
}

###

### Register user with empty fields (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "name": "",
    "phone": "",
    "address": "",
    "password": ""
}

###

### Register with empty body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Get existing user by ID (replace with a valid ID from POST response)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_USER_ID

###

### Get non-existing user (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/nonexistent-id-999

###


### ==================== TOKENS (Login) ====================

### Login with correct credentials (expect 200 + user ID)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "israel_israeli",
    "password": "mySecretPassword"
}

###

### Login with wrong password (expect 401 or error)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "israel_israeli",
    "password": "wrongPassword"
}

###

### Login with non-existing user (expect 404 or error)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ghost_user",
    "password": "doesntMatter"
}

###

### Login with missing password (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "israel_israeli"
}

###

### Login with empty body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###


### ==================== RESTAURANTS ====================

### Get all restaurants (empty list initially, expect 200 + [])
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants

###

### Create a new restaurant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Pizza Palace",
    "phone": "03-1234567",
    "email": "pizza@palace.com",
    "address": "123 Main St, Tel Aviv",
    "hours": "10:00-23:00",
    "description": "Best pizza in town"
}

###

### Create a second restaurant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Burger Barn",
    "phone": "04-7654321",
    "email": "info@burgerbarn.com",
    "address": "456 Side St, Haifa",
    "hours": "11:00-22:00",
    "description": "Juicy burgers and loaded fries"
}

###

### Create duplicate restaurant (same name, expect 409 or 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Pizza Palace",
    "phone": "03-0000000",
    "email": "info@Somewhereelse.com",
    "address": "Somewhere else",
    "hours": "11:00-22:00",
    "description": "Somewhere else description"
}

###

### Create restaurant with missing name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "phone": "03-0000000",
    "address": "789 Other St"
}

###

### Create restaurant with empty body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{}

###

### Get all restaurants (should show the two created ones)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants

###

### Get a specific restaurant by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID

###

### Get non-existing restaurant (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/nonexistent-restaurant-id

###

### Update restaurant name and hours (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Pizza Palace Updated",
    "hours": "09:00-00:00"
}

###

### Update restaurant to a duplicate name (expect 409 or 400)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Burger Barn"
}

###

### Update non-existing restaurant (expect 404)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/nonexistent-restaurant-id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Doesn't Matter"
}

###

### Delete a restaurant (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Delete non-existing restaurant (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/nonexistent-restaurant-id
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###


### ==================== PRODUCTS (Menu) ====================

### Get all products for a restaurant (empty initially)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/2789e062-97a3-4aec-89e5-5cc661715896/products

###

### Add a product to a restaurant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/2789e062-97a3-4aec-89e5-5cc661715896/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Margherita Pizza",
    "pdescription": "Classic tomato and mozzarella",
    "price": 52
}

###

### Add a second product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/2789e062-97a3-4aec-89e5-5cc661715896/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Pepperoni Pizza",
    "pdescription": "Tomato, mozzarella and pepperoni",
    "price": 62
}

###

### Add duplicate product (same pname, expect 409 or 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Margherita Pizza",
    "pdescription": "Duplicate entry",
    "price": 45
}

###

### Add product with missing pname (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pdescription": "No name product",
    "price": 30
}

###

### Add product with empty body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{}

###

### Add product to non-existing restaurant (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/nonexistent-restaurant-id/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Ghost Pizza",
    "pdescription": "Shouldn't exist",
    "price": 50
}

###

### Get all products for a restaurant
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products

###

### Get a specific product by ID (also triggers a view in Ex2 server)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID

###

### Get non-existing product (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/nonexistent-product-id

###

### Get product from non-existing restaurant (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/nonexistent-restaurant-id/products/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID

###

### Update a product — name and price (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Margherita Pizza XL",
    "price": 65
}

###

### Update product to duplicate pname (expect 409 or 400)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Pepperoni Pizza"
}

###

### Update non-existing product (expect 404)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/nonexistent-product-id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "pname": "Doesn't Matter"
}

###

### Delete a product (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Delete non-existing product (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/restaurants/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID/products/nonexistent-product-id
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###


### ==================== ORDERS ====================

### Create a new order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "restaurantId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID",
    "products": [
        "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID"
    ],
    "status": "pending"
}

###

### Create order with no products (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "restaurantId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_RESTAURANT_ID",
    "products": []
}

###

### Create order with missing restaurantId (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "products": [
        "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID"
    ]
}

###

### Create order with empty body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{}

###

### Get all orders for the logged-in user
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Get orders for a different user (should return only their orders)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
X-User-Id: REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_VALID_USER_ID

###

### Get a specific order by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Get non-existing order (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/nonexistent-order-id
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Update an order — change status and products (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_ORDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "products": [
        "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PRODUCT_ID"
    ],
    "status": "confirmed"
}

###

### Verify protected fields are immutable — id, userId, createdAt should not change
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_ORDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "id": "hacked-id",
    "userId": "hacked-user",
    "createdAt": "1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "status": "cancelled"
}

###

### Update non-existing order (expect 404)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/orders/nonexistent-order-id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

{
    "status": "cancelled"
}

###

### Delete an order (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_VALID_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###

### Delete non-existing order (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/orders/nonexistent-order-id
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_VALID_TOKEN

###


### ==================== SEARCH ====================

### Search matching a restaurant name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/Burger Barn

###

### Search matching a restaurant description
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/burger

###

### Search matching a product pname
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/Nuclear Taco v2

### Search matching a product pdescription
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/Stress 

###

### Case-insensitive search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/PIZZA

###

### Search with no matches (expect 200 + empty array)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/xyznotfound

###

### Search with a single character
GET http://localhost:5000/api/search/r

